WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
The person in a red jacket is sitting at a table, holding their head with one hand.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
The person in a red shirt is writing in a notebook with a calculator beside them.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
The person in a red shirt is sitting at a laptop with their hands on the keyboard.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
The person in a red shirt types on their laptop while looking at articles about staying awake, with a notebook beside them.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.000
The person's laptop screen displays information about caffeine intake and sleep patterns.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.000
The person in a red jacket stands up and walks down the stairs.

00:48.000 --> 00:56.000
A person in red clothes walks up wooden stairs to a room with large windows showing greenery, then pours something from an orange container.

00:56.000 --> 01:04.000
The person points at an Encore coffee grinder next to a glass jar of beans.

01:04.000 --> 01:12.000
The person points to the control panel of a coffee maker while two others are on the table nearby.

01:12.000 --> 01:20.000
The person pours coffee grounds into an empty mug held in their left hand.

01:20.000 --> 01:28.000
The person uses an Italian espresso maker, with a pot of water boiling on the stove behind them.

01:28.000 --> 01:36.000
The person pours coffee into a small cup placed on a wooden table with its saucer.

01:36.000 --> 01:44.000
The person in a red sweater adjusts their glasses while sitting at the table with coffee and chips.

01:44.000 --> 01:50.610
The person holds a red package of caffeine-free, 100% Arabica coffee with an illustrated woman on it.
